style=\\\"font-size: 18px; margin-top: 20px; max-width: 450px; color: #F2E8CF; line-height: 1.6;\\\">The essence of the alpine experience lies in this stark seasonal duality. From the explosive life of summer to the elemental purity of winter, the landscape undergoes a radical transformation, revealing different facets of its enduring character. Each season presents a unique, unadulterated perspective.</p><div style=\\\"position: absolute; bottom: 40px; left: 40px; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #D46A00; \\\">03</div></div>\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}]',1,1,1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO posts (id,user_id,username,title,description,hashtags,tokens_prompt,tokens_save,tokens_autopost,carousel_data,created_at,chat_history,likes_count,is_liked,is_shared) VALUES ('p_b87e3c8b','u1','Roi Chocron','ALPINE VIBRANCY','A visual exploration of alpine landscapes, contrasting their summer vitality with winter starkness. Minimalist typography and brutalist design elements highlight the seasonal duality.','#AlpineSeasons #LandscapeDesign #WinterVsSummer #NatureContrast',1420,538,1200,'{"id":"p_b87e3c8b","author_name":"Roi Chocron","created_at":"2026-08-26T19:50:55.599Z","description":"A visual exploration of alpine landscapes, contrasting their summer vitality with winter starkness. Minimalist typography and brutalist design elements highlight the seasonal duality.","hashtags":"#AlpineSeasons #LandscapeDesign #WinterVsSummer #NatureContrast","slides":[{"slide_index":0,"tag":"SUMMER","title":"ALPINE VIBRANCY","background_style":"background-color: #0A1128; color: #F0F3BD; overflow: hidden; position: relative; font-family: ''Heebo'', sans-serif; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;","html_content":"<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><div style=\"width:540px; height:540px; box-sizing:border-box; overflow:hidden; position:relative; background-color: #0A1128; color: #F0F3BD; font-family: ''Heebo'', sans-serif; display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; padding: 40px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 70px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 0.9; letter-spacing: -0.05em; margin-bottom: 10px;\">ALPINE</div><div style=\"font-size: 70px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 0.9; letter-spacing: -0.05em; margin-bottom: 30px;\">VIBRANCY</div><p style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 300; max-width: 400px;\">During warmer months, alpine terrain awakens. Lush meadows, carpeted with wildflowers, dominate the lower slopes. Rivers, swollen with snowmelt, carve through rock. The air is crisp, the skies clear, and life flourishes under intense sunlight.</p><div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 20px; right: 20px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #FF7B25; border: 2px solid #FF7B25; padding: 5px 10px;\">SUMMER</div></div>"},{"slide_index":1,"tag":"WINTER","title":"ALPINE STILLNESS","background_style":"background-color: #FF7B25; color: #0A1128; overflow: hidden; position: relative; font-family: ''Heebo'', sans-serif; display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; align-items: flex-end; box-shadow: 8px 8px 0px #0A1128;","html_content":"<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><div style=\"width:540px; height:540px; box-sizing:border-box; overflow:hidden; position:relative; background-color: #FF7B25; color: #0A1128; font-family: ''Heebo'', sans-serif; display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; align-items: flex-end; flex-direction: column; padding: 40px; border: 3px solid #0A1128;\"><div style=\"font-size: 70px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 0.9; letter-spacing: -0.05em; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: right;\">ALPINE</div><div style=\"font-size: 70px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 0.9; letter-spacing: -0.05em; margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: right;\">STILLNESS</div><p style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 300; max-width: 400px; text-align: right;\">Winter transforms the landscape into a monochromatic study. Snow blankets everything, smoothing harsh lines and muting sound. Vegetation retreats, leaving stark trees and exposed rock formations. The silence is profound, punctuated only by wind and the occasional avalanche.</p><div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 20px; left: 20px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #0A1128; border: 2px solid #0A1128; padding: 5px 10px;\">WINTER</div></div>"},{"slide_index":2,"tag":"CONTRAST","title":"THE DICHOTOMY","background_style":"background-color: #F0F3BD; color: #0A1128; overflow: hidden; position: relative; font-family: ''Heebo'', sans-serif; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;","html_content":"<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><div style=\"width:540px; height:540px; box-sizing:border-box; overflow:hidden; position:relative; background-color: #F0F3BD; color: #0A1128; font-family: ''Heebo'', sans-serif; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-direction: column; padding: 40px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 60px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center;\">SEASONAL <br> RECALIBRATION</div><p style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 400; max-width: 450px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\">The alpine zone is defined by its extreme seasonal shifts. From the riot of summer green to the stark, silent beauty of winter white, these environments demonstrate nature''s powerful cycles of growth and dormancy.</p><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-around; width: 100%; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #FF7B25;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">LIFE</span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">REST</span></div></div>"}]}','2026-08-26 19:50:55','[{"role":"user","content":"תיצור לי פוסט קרוסלה שמסביר מה ההבדל בין סוגי הנופים של האלפים בקיץ ובחורף עם תמונות רפרנס"},{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"id\": \"f7e4c1a3-d5e8-4b2a-9f0d-1c7e6a9b0d2e\",\n  \"author_name\": \"Avant-Garde Artistry\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2023-10-27T10:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"tokens_used\": 250,\n  \"description\": \"A visual exploration of alpine landscapes, contrasting their summer vitality with winter starkness. Minimalist typography and brutalist design elements highlight the seasonal duality.\",\n  \"hashtags\": \"#AlpineSeasons #LandscapeDesign #WinterVsSummer #NatureContrast\",\n  \"slides\": [\n    {\n      \"slide_index\": 0,\n      \"tag\": \"SUMMER\",\n      \"title\": \"ALPINE VIBRANCY\",\n      \"background_style\": \"background-color: #0A1128; color: #F0F3BD; overflow: hidden; position: relative; font-family: ''Heebo'', sans-serif; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;\",\n      \"html_content\": \"<link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\"><div style=\\\"width:540px; height:540px; box-sizing:border-box; overflow:hidden; position:relative; background-color: #0A1128; color: #F0F3BD; font-family: ''Heebo'', sans-serif; display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; padding: 40px;\\\"><div style=\\\"font-size: 70px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 0.9; letter-spacing: -0.05em; margin-bottom: 10px;\\\">ALPINE</div><div style=\\\"font-size: 70px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 0.9; letter-spacing: -0.05em; margin-bottom: 30px;\\\">VIBRANCY</div><p style=\\\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 300; max-width: 400px;\\\">During warmer months, alpine terrain awakens. Lush meadows, carpeted with wildflowers, dominate the lower slopes. Rivers, swollen with snowmelt, carve through rock. The air is crisp, the skies clear, and life flourishes under intense sunlight.</p><div style=\\\"position: absolute; bottom: 20px; right: 20px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #FF7B25; border: 2px solid #FF7B25; padding: 5px 10px;\\\">SUMMER</div></div>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"slide_index\": 1,\n      \"tag\": \"WINTER\",\n      \"title\": \"ALPINE STILLNESS\",\n      \"background_style\": \"background-color: #FF7B25; color: #0A1128; overflow: hidden; position: relative; font-family: ''Heebo'', sans-serif; display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; align-items: flex-end; box-shadow: 8px 8px 0px #0A1128;\",\n      \"html_content\": \"<link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\"><div style=\\\"width:540px; height:540px; box-sizing:border-box; overflow:hidden; position:relative; background-color: #FF7B25; color: #0A1128; font-family: ''Heebo'', sans-serif; display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; align-items: flex-end; flex-direction: column; padding: 40px; border: 3px solid #0A1128;\\\"><div style=\\\"font-size: 70px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 0.9; letter-spacing: -0.05em; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: right;\\\">ALPINE</div><div style=\\\"font-size: 70px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 0.9; letter-spacing: -0.05em; margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: right;\\\">STILLNESS</div><p style=\\\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 300; max-width: 400px; text-align: right;\\\">Winter transforms the landscape into a monochromatic study. Snow blankets everything, smoothing harsh lines and muting sound. Vegetation retreats, leaving stark trees and exposed rock formations. The silence is profound, punctuated only by wind and the occasional avalanche.</p><div style=\\\"position: absolute; bottom: 20px; left: 20px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #0A1128; border: 2px solid #0A1128; padding: 5px 10px;\\\">WINTER</div></div>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"slide_index\": 2,\n      \"tag\": \"CONTRAST\",\n      \"title\": \"THE DICHOTOMY\",\n      \"background_style\": \"background-color: #F0F3BD; color: #0A1128; overflow: hidden; position: relative; font-family: ''Heebo'', sans-serif; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;\",\n      \"html_content\": \"<link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\"><div style=\\\"width:540px; height:540px; box-sizing:border-box; overflow:hidden; position:relative; background-color: #F0F3BD; color: #0A1128; font-family: ''Heebo'', sans-serif; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-direction: column; padding: 40px;\\\"><div style=\\\"font-size: 60px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center;\\\">SEASONAL <br> RECALIBRATION</div><p style=\\\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 400; max-width: 450px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\\\">The alpine zone is defined by its extreme seasonal shifts. From the riot of summer green to the stark, silent beauty of winter white, these environments demonstrate nature''s powerful cycles of growth and dormancy.</p><div style=\\\"display: flex; justify-content: space-around; width: 100%; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #FF7B25;\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">LIFE</span><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">REST</span></div></div>\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}]',0,0,0);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO posts (id,user_id,username,title,description,hashtags,tokens_prompt,tokens_save,tokens_autopost,carousel_data,created_at,chat_history,likes_count,is_liked,is_shared) VALUES ('p_64253b31','u1','Roi Chocron','ALPINE SUMMER: AN ASCENSION','An editorial exploration of Alpine summer versus winter landscapes, rendered through extreme typographic and color contrast. Avant-garde design principles applied.','#AlpineLandscapes #Seasons #AvantGardeDesign #UIUX #EditorialDesign',3308,1639,1200,'{"id":"p_64253b31","author_name":"Roi Chocron","created_at":"2026-08-26T19:54:40.010Z","description":"An editorial exploration of Alpine summer versus winter landscapes, rendered through extreme typographic and color contrast. Avant-garde design principles applied.","hashtags":"#AlpineLandscapes #Seasons #AvantGardeDesign #UIUX #EditorialDesign","slides":[{"slide_index":0,"tag":"Summer Alpine","title":"ALPINE SUMMER: AN ASCENSION","background_style":"background-color: #0A1F1A; color: #F5F0E4;","html_content":"<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><div style=\"width:540px; height:540px; box-sizing:border-box; padding: 40px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; align-items:flex-start; font-family:''Heebo'', sans-serif; background-color: #0A1F1A; color: #F5F0E4; overflow:hidden;\"><h1 style=\"font-size: 48px; line-height: 0.9; letter-spacing: -0.05em; margin:0; padding:0; font-weight:900;\">ALPINE SUMMER: <br>AN ASCENSION</h1><p style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.4; margin-top: 30px; max-width: 450px;\">Verdant slopes ascend towards cerulean skies. Life pulses vibrantly; meadows carpeted in wildflowers, streams carve energetic paths through ancient rock. Air, crisp and thin, carries the scent of pine and distant rain. A season of growth and potent vitality.</p><div style=\"width: 120px; height: 120px; background-color: #E64A19; margin-top: 40px; box-shadow: 8px 8px 0px #0A1F1A;\"></div></div>"},{"slide_index":1,"tag":"Winter Alpine","title":"THE WINTER STILLNESS","background_style":"background-color: #E64A19; color: #0A1F1A;","html_content":"<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><div style=\"width:540px; height:540px; box-sizing:border-box; padding: 40px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:flex-end; align-items:center; font-family:''Heebo'', sans-serif; background-color: #E64A19; color: #0A1F1A; overflow:hidden;\"><h2 style=\"font-size: 36px; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin-bottom: 15px; font-weight:700;\">THE WINTER STILLNESS</h2><p style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.4; max-width: 500px; text-align:center;\">White silence descends. Peaks stand stark, etched against muted greys. Fauna recedes, vegetation sleeps under a frozen mantle. Sound is muffled, the world reduced to the whisper of wind and the crunch of ice. A period of stark, profound repose.</p><div style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px; background-color: #0A1F1A; margin-top: 50px; box-shadow: -8px -8px 0px #E64A19;\"></div></div>"},{"slide_index":2,"tag":"Contrast","title":"THE ALCHEMICAL SHIFT","background_style":"background-color: #F5F0E4; color: #0A1F1A;","html_content":"<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><div style=\"width:540px; height:540px; box-sizing:border-box; padding: 60px 40px 40px 40px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:flex-start; align-items:flex-end; font-family:''Heebo'', sans-serif; background-color: #F5F0E4; color: #0A1F1A; overflow:hidden;\"><h3 style=\"font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 20px; font-weight:400; border-bottom: 3px solid #E64A19; padding-bottom: 5px;\">THE ALCHEMICAL SHIFT</h3><p style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.4; max-width: 480px; text-align:right;\">From the explosion of s