''>בונה אתרים vs מעצב אתרים</div><h1 style=''font-weight:900;font-size:36px;letter-spacing:-0.05em;line-height:0.95;margin:0 0 20px;''>מה ההבדל?</h1><p style=''font-weight:400;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;''>הבדל מהותי בין שני התפקידים טמון בהיקף האחריות ובכלים בהם הם משתמשים. בונה אתרים מתמקד בהטמעת פתרונות טכניים, בעוד שמעצב אתרים אחראי על החוויה החזותית והאסטרטגיה של המותג. שניהם משלימים זה את זה בתהליך הפיתוח.</p></div><div style=''position:absolute;top:0;right:0;width:40%;height:100%;background:#FF00FF;clip-path:polygon(0 0,100% 0,80% 100%,0 100%);''></div></div>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"slide_index\": 1,\n      \"tag\": \"בונה אתרים\",\n      \"title\": \"מה זה בונה אתרים?\",\n      \"background_style\": \"background:#FF00FF;\",\n      \"html_content\": \"<link href=''https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap'' rel=''stylesheet''><div style=''position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background:#FF00FF;color:#0A0A0A;font-family:\\\"Heebo\\\",sans-serif;direction:rtl;text-align:right;overflow:hidden;''><div style=''position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;width:100%;height:40%;padding:30px;box-sizing:border-box;box-shadow:6px 6px 0px #0A0A0A;border:3px solid #0A0A0a;background:url(\\\"/uploads/img_1789112403429_735.png\\\") center/cover no-repeat,rgba(10,10,10,0.6);''><div style=''display:inline-block;background:#0A0A0A;color:#FF00FF;padding:4px 8px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:12px;''>בונה אתרים</div><h1 style=''font-weight:900;font-size:30px;letter-spacing:-0.05em;line-height:0.95;margin:0 0 16px;''>מה זה בונה אתרים?</h1><p style=''font-weight:400;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;color:#F5F5F5;''>בונה אתרים עובד בעיקר עם פלטפורמות כמו Wix, Squarespace או WordPress, שם הוא מגדיר מבנה, מוסיף תכנים ומקדם ביצועים בסיסיים. עבודתו דורשת ידע ב-HTML, CSS בסיסי ובהבנת זרימת משתמש, אך ללא צורך בעיצוב גרפי מורכב.</p></div></div>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"slide_index\": 2,\n      \"tag\": \"מעצב אתרים\",\n      \"title\": \"מה זה מעצב אתרים?\",\n      \"background_style\": \"background:#F5F5F5;\",\n      \"html_content\": \"<link href=''https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap'' rel=''stylesheet''><div style=''position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background:#F5F5F5;color:#0A0A0A;font-family:\\\"Heebo\\\",sans-serif;direction:rtl;text-align:right;overflow:hidden;''><div style=''position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:60%;height:100%;padding:0 80px 0 0;box-sizing:border-box;''><div style=''display:inline-block;background:#FF00FF;color:#0A0A0A;padding:4px 8px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:12px;''>מעצב אתרים</div><h1 style=''font-weight:900;font-size:32px;letter-spacing:-0.05em;line-height:0.95;margin:0 0 16px;''>מה זה מעצב אתרים?</h1><p style=''font-weight:400;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;''>מעצב אתרים מתמקד באפיונון חזותי, בחירת טיפוגרפיה, צבעים ואייקונים שמייצרים זהות מותגית אחידה. הוא משתמש בכלי גרפיקה כמו Figma או Adobe XD כדי לייצר מאקטים אינטראקטיביים ולבדוק את הזרימה לפני פיתוח. תפקידו לגשר בין אסתטיקה לפונקציונליות.</p></div><div style=''position:absolute;top:0;right:0;width:8px;height:100%;background:#FF00FF;''></div></div>\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}]',0,0,0);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO posts (id,user_id,username,title,description,hashtags,tokens_prompt,tokens_save,tokens_autopost,carousel_data,created_at,chat_history,likes_count,is_liked,is_shared) VALUES ('p_16e68312','u1','Roi Chocron','AI Integration: Beyond Basic Automation','Deconstructing AI operational paradigms through a series of focused, brutalist design slides.','#AITechniques #DigitalStrategy #MachineIntelligence',1776,829,0,'{"id":"p_16e68312","author_name":"Roi Chocron","created_at":"2026-09-11T11:09:04.724Z","description":"Deconstructing AI operational paradigms through a series of focused, brutalist design slides.","hashtags":"#AITechniques #DigitalStrategy #MachineIntelligence","slides":[{"slide_index":0,"tag":"AI PRINCIPLES","title":"AI Integration: Beyond Basic Automation","background_style":"background-color: #1E1E2F;","html_content":"<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><div style=\"font-family: ''Heebo'', sans-serif; width: 100%; height: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; padding: 20px; color: #F0F0F0; position: relative;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 3px; height: 100%; background-color: #00FFCC;\"></div><div style=\"position: absolute; top: 20px; left: 30px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #00FFCC; text-transform: uppercase;\">AI PRINCIPLES</div><h1 style=\"font-size: 48px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: -0.05em; margin: 80px 0 0 30px; max-width: 400px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F0F0F0;\">AI Integration: Beyond Basic Automation</h1><p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.4; margin: 20px 30px 20px 200px; max-width: 300px; text-align: left;\">Effective AI deployment demands precise data governance and rigorous model validation. Avoid feature creep by focusing on singular, high-impact problems. Integrate iteratively, monitor continuously, and prioritize explainability over raw complexity.</p><img src=\"/uploads/gen_svg_1789124925385_0_504.svg\" alt=\"Abstract AI decision-making\" style=\"position: absolute; bottom: -50px; right: -50px; width: 300px; height: auto; object-fit: contain; filter: drop-shadow(8px 8px 0px #00FFCC);\"></div>"},{"slide_index":1,"tag":"TRANSPARENCY","title":"Algorithmic Clarity","background_style":"background-color: #00FFCC; background-image: url(''/uploads/gen_svg_1789124925483_1_936.svg''); background-size: cover; background-position: center;","html_content":"<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><div style=\"font-family: ''Heebo'', sans-serif; width: 100%; height: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: flex-start; padding: 0;\"><div style=\"background-color: #00FFCC; border: 3px solid #1E1E2F; box-shadow: 10px 10px 0px #1E1E2F; padding: 30px; width: 380px; height: 380px; margin-bottom: 40px; margin-left: 40px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #1E1E2F; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;\"><div style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #1E1E2F; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 15px;\">TRANSPARENCY</div><h1 style=\"font-size: 36px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0; text-transform: uppercase; color: #1E1E2F;\">Algorithmic Clarity</h1><p style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.4; margin-top: 20px;\">Understanding AI output requires transparency in its decision-making processes. Implement explainable AI (XAI) frameworks from inception. Document model biases and limitations rigorously. A clear audit trail is paramount for operational integrity and trust in autonomous systems.</p></div></div>"},{"slide_index":2,"tag":"STRATEGY","title":"Strategic AI Deployment","background_style":"background-color: #F0F0F0;","html_content":"<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><div style=\"font-family: ''Heebo'', sans-serif; width: 100%; height: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end; padding: 20px; color: #1E1E2F;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 60%;\"><!-- Pure Empty Void for top 60% --></div><div style=\"width: 100%; padding: 20px 0; box-sizing: border-box; text-align: left; background-color: #F0F0F0;\"><div style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #00FFCC; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px;\">STRATEGY</div><h1 style=\"font-size: 32px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.04em; margin-bottom: 15px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #1E1E2F;\">Strategic AI Deployment</h1><p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 20px; max-width: 480px;\">Maximize AI utility by aligning initiatives with core business objectives. Prioritize scalable infrastructure and robust security protocols. Avoid uncritical adoption; evaluate ROI and ethical implications before committing significant resources.</p><ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px;\"><li style=\"background-color: #00FFCC; color: #1E1E2F; padding: 8px 15px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; border: 2px solid #1E1E2F; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px #1E1E2F;\">Data Hygiene</li><li style=\"background-color: #00FFCC; color: #1E1E2F; padding: 8px 15px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; border: 2px solid #1E1E2F; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px #1E1E2F;\">Model Iteration</li><li style=\"background-color: #00FFCC; color: #1E1E2F; padding: 8px 15px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; border: 2px solid #1E1E2F; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px #1E1E2F;\">Ethical Oversight</li></ul><img src=\"/uploads/gen_svg_1789124925670_2_984.svg\" alt=\"Abstract AI learning graph\" style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 20px; right: 20px; width: 150px; height: auto; object-fit: contain; filter: drop-shadow(6px 6px 0px #00FFCC);\"></div></div>"}],"contrastReport":{"score":50,"status":"fail","totalElements":12,"passedElements":6,"failedElements":6,"slideResults":[{"slideNumber":1,"title":"AI Integration: Beyond Basic Automation","elementsCount":6,"issuesCount":3,"hasBgImage":true,"hasOverlay":false,"issues":[{"element":"<div>","text":"AI PRINCIPLES","ratio":1,"targetRatio":4.5,"isPass":false,"issue":"Low contrast ratio (1.00:1 vs required 4.5:1 for WCAG AA). Color: #00FFCC on #00FFCC.","recommendation":"Use high-contrast color (e.g., #FFFFFF on dark or #1A202C on light) or add a backdrop overlay."},{"element":"<h1>","text":"AI Integration: Beyond Basic Automation","ratio":1.14,"targetRatio":3,"isPass":false,"issue":"Low contrast ratio (1.14:1 vs required 3:1 for WCAG AA). Color: #F0F0F0 on #00FFCC.","recommendation":"Use high-contrast color (e.g., #FFFFFF on dark or #1A202C on light) or add a backdrop overlay."},{"element":"<p>","text":"Effective AI deployment demands preci...","ratio":12.57,"targetRatio":4.5,"isPass":false,"issue":"Text is placed over background image/gradient without dark overlay or text-shadow protection.","recommendation":"Use high-contrast color (e.g., #FFFFFF on dark or #1A202C on light) or add a backdrop overlay."}]},{"slideNumber":2,"title":"Algorithmic Clarity","elementsCount":3,"issuesCount":0,"hasBgImage":false,"hasOverlay":false,"issues":[]},{"slideNumber":3,"title":"Strategic AI Deployment","elementsCount":9,"issuesCount":3,"hasBgImage":true,"hasOverlay":false,"issues":[{"element":"<div>","text":"STRATEGY","ratio":1.14,"targetRatio":4.5,"isPass":false,"issue":"Low contrast ratio (1.14:1 vs required 4.5:1 for WCAG AA). Color: #00FFCC on #F0F0F0.","recommendation":"Use high-contrast color (e.g., #FFFFFF on dark or #1A202C on light) or add a backdrop overlay."},{"element":"<h1>","text":"Strategic AI Deployment","ratio":14.37,"targetRatio":3,"isPass":false,"issue":"Text is placed over background image/gradient without dark overlay or text-shadow protection.","recommendation":"Use high-contrast color (e.g., #FFFFFF on dark or #1A202C on light) or add a backdrop overlay."},{"element":"<p>","text":"Maximize AI utility by aligning initi...","ratio":14.32,"targetRatio":4.5,"isPass":false,"issue":"Text is placed over background image/gradient without dark overlay or text-shadow protection.","recommendation":"Use high-contrast color (e.g., #FFFFFF on dark or #1A202C on light) or add a backdrop overlay."}]}]}}','2026-09-11 11:09:04','[{"role":"user","content":"צור פוסט קרוסלה מעוצב עם 3 שקופיות בנושא טיפים לבינה מלאכותית, ותוסיף תמונה לכל שקופית"},{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"type\":\"image_plan\",\"images\":[{\"description\":\"Minimalist abstract representation of AI decision-making. Geometric shapes in dark blue and bright cyan, sharp edges, clean lines, on a stark white background. No people, no robots, just pure data visualization aesthetic. High contrast.\"},{\"description\":\"Conceptual image of AI integration in everyday objects. Subtle glowing cyan circuit lines subtly woven into the texture of mundane items like a coffee cup or a book. Dark, moody background with deep shadows and a single, sharp light source. Minimalist.\"},{\"description\":\"Visual metaphor for AI learning and evolution. A single, sharp line graph rapidly ascending and then branching into complex, chaotic patterns. Colors are stark black, white, and electric magenta. Extreme focus on the line itself, abstract background.\"}]}"},{"role":"user","content":"Images generated successfully. URLs: /uploads/gen_svg_1789124925385_0_504.svg, /uploads/gen_svg_1789124925483_1_936.svg, /uploads/gen_svg_1789124925670_2_984.svg. Please write the HTML for the carousel using these images in <img> tags or background-image CSS style."},{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"id\": \"2d1f9a5e-b8c2-4e0a-8d1e-c7a8b6f3a1d6\",\n  \"author_name\": \"Astraeus Collective\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2024-07-29T10:30:00.000Z\",\n  \"tokens_used\": 750,\n  \"description\": \"Deconstructing AI operational paradigms through a series of focused, brutalist design slides.\",\n  \"hashtags\": \"#AITechniques #DigitalStrategy #MachineIntelligence\",\n  \"slides\": [\n    {\n      \"slide_index\": 0,\n      \"tag\": \"AI PRINCIPLES\",\n      \"title\": \"AI Integration: Beyond Basic Automation\",\n      \"background_style\": \"background-color: #1E1E2F;\",\n      \"html_content\": \"<link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\"><div style=\\\"font-family: ''Heebo'', sans-serif; width: 100%; height: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; padding: 20px; color: #F0F0F0; position: relative;\\\"><div style=\\\"position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 3px; height: 100%; background-color: #00FFCC;\\\"></div><div style=\\\"position: absolute; top: 20px; left: 30px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #00FFCC; text-transform: uppercase;\\\">AI PRINCIPLES</div><h1 style=\\\"font-size: 48px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: -0.05em; margin: 80px 0 0 30px; max-width: 400px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F0F0F0;\\\">AI Integration: Beyond Basic Automation</h1><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.4; margin: 20px 30px 20px 200px; max-width: 300px; text-align: left;\\\">Effective AI deployment demands precise data governance and rigorous model validation. Avoid feature creep by focusing on singular, high-impact problems. Integrate iteratively, monitor continuously, and prioritize explainability over raw complexity.</p><img src=\\\"/uploads/gen_svg_1789124925385_0_504.svg\\\" alt=\\\"Abstract AI decision-making\\\" style=\\\"position: absolute; bottom: -50px; right: -50px; width: 300px; height: auto; object-fit: contain; filter: drop-shadow(8px 8px 0px #00FFCC);\\\"></div>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"slide_index\": 1,\n      \"tag\": \"TRANSPARENCY\",\n      \"title\": \"Algorithmic Clarity\",\n      \"background_style\": \"background-color: #00FFCC; background-image: url(''/uploads/gen_svg_1789124925483_1_936.svg''); background-size: cover; background-position: center;\",\n      \"html_content\": \"<link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\"><div style=\\\"font-family: ''Heebo'', sans-serif; width: 100%; height: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: flex-start; padding: 0;\\\"><div style=\\\"background-color: #00FFCC; border: 3px solid #1E1E2F; box-shadow: 10px 10px 0px #1E1E2F; padding: 30px; width: 380px; height: 380px; margin-bottom: 40px; margin-left: 40px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #1E1E2F; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;\\\"><div style=\\\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #1E1E2F; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 15px;\\\">TRANSPARENCY</div><h1 style=\\\"font-size: 36px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0; text-transform: uppercase; color: #1E1E2F;\\\">Algorithmic Clarity</h1><p style=\\\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.4; margin-top: 20px;\\\">Understanding AI output requires transparency in its decision-making processes. Implement explainable AI (XAI) frameworks from inception. Document model biases and limitations rigorously. A clear audit trail is paramount for operational integrity and trust in autonomous systems.</p></div></div>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"slide_index\": 2,\n      \"tag\": \"STRATEGY\",\n      \"title\": \"Strategic AI Deployment\",\n      \"background_style\": \"background-color: #F0F0F0;\",\n      \"html_content\": \"<link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\"><div style=\\\"font-family: ''Heebo'', sans-serif; width: 100%; height: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end; padding: 20px; color: #1E1E2F;\\\"><div style=\\\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 60%;\\\"><!-- Pure Empty Void for top 60% --></div><div style=\\\"width: 100%; padding: 20px 0; box-sizing: border-box; text-align: left; background-color: #F0F0F0;\\\"><div style=\\\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #00FFCC; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px;\\\">STRATEGY</div><h1 style=\\\"font-size: 32px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.04em; margin-bottom: 15px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #1E1E2F;\\\">Strategic AI Deployment</h1><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 20px; max-width: 480px;\\\">Maximize AI utility by aligning initiatives with core business objectives. Prioritize scalable infrastructure and robust security protocols. Avoid uncritical adoption; evaluate ROI and ethical implications before committing significant resources.</p><ul style=\\\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px;\\\"><li style=\\\"background-color: #00FFCC; color: #1E1E2F; padding: 8px 15px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; border: 2px solid #1E1E2F; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px #1E1E2F;\\\">Data Hygiene</li><li style=\\\"background-color: #00FFCC; color: #1E1E2F; padding: 8px 15px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; border: 2px solid #1E1E2F; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px #1E1E2F;\\\">Model Iteration</li><li style=\\\"background-color: #00FFCC; color: #1E1E2F; padding: 8px 15px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; border: 2px solid #1E1E2F; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px #1E1E2F;\\\">Ethical Oversight</li></ul><img src=\\\"/uploads/gen_svg_1789124925670_2_984.svg\\\" alt=\\\"Abstract AI learning graph\\\" style=\\\"position: absolute; bottom: 20px; right: 20px; width: 150px; height: auto; object-fit: contain; filter: drop-shadow(6px 6px 0px #00FFCC);\\\"></div></div>\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}]',0,0,0);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO posts (id,user_id,username,title,description,hashtags,tokens_prompt,tokens_save,tokens_autopost,carousel_data,created_at,chat_history,likes_count,is_liked,is_shared) VALUES ('p_887cca94','u1','Roi Chocron','AI Integration: Strategic Imperatives','An avant-garde exploration of strategic AI integration, model optimization, and human-AI interface design principles across a three-slide carousel.','#AITips #StrategicAI #HumanAI #TechDesign #DigitalBrutalism',1766,696,1200,'{"id":"p_887cca94","author_name":"Roi Chocron","created_at":"2026-09-11T11:17:36.359Z","description":"An avant-garde exploration of strategic AI integration, model optimization, and human-AI interface design principles across a three-slide carousel.","hashtags":"#AITips #StrategicAI #HumanAI #TechDesign #DigitalBrutalism","slides":[{"slide_index":0,"tag":"STRATEGY","title":"AI Integration: Strategic Imperatives","background_style":"background-color: #0F1A2B;","html_content":"<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><div style=\"width:100%; height:100%; box-sizing:border-box; overflow:hidden; font-family:''Heebo'', sans-serif; position:relative; direction:ltr; background-color: #0F1A2B;\"><img src=\"/uploads/gen_svg_1789125434297_0_138.svg\" style=\"position:absolute; left:0; top:0; width:65%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; filter: contrast(1.2);\"/><div style=\"position:absolute; right:0; top:0; width:45%; height:100%; padding:40px 30px; box-sizing:border-box; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:700; color:#F50057; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:15px; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">STRATEGY</span><h1 style=\"font-size:48px; font-weight:900; color:#EAEAEA; line-height:0.95; letter-spacing:-0.05em; margin:0 0 20px 0;\">AI Integration: Strategic Imperatives</h1><p style=\"font-size:17px; font-weight:400; color:#EAEAEA; line-height:1.4; margin:0;\">Integrating AI demands a precise strategy. Focus on problem identification over technology acquisition. Prioritize ethical frameworks from conception. Data governance is paramount; secure, clean data fuels effective models. Avoid reactive implementation for sustainable growth.</p></div><div style=\"position:absolute; bottom:20px; right:30px; font-size:120px; font-weight:900; color:rgba(234,234,234,0.1); line-height:1; pointer-events:none;\">01</div></div>"},{"slide_index":1,"tag":"OPTIMIZATION","title":"Optimizing Model Performance","background_style":"background-color: #F50057;","html_content":"<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><div style=\"width:100%; height:100%; box-sizing:border-box; overflow:hidden; font-family:''Heebo'', sans-serif; position:relative; direction:ltr; background-color: #F50057; display:flex;\"><div style=\"width:40%; background-color:#F50057; display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items:center; position:relative; border-right:3px solid #0F1A2B;\"><img src=\"/uploads/gen_svg_1789125434562_1_988.svg\" style=\"position:absolute; left:0; top:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; mix-blend-mode:luminosity; opacity:0.7;\"/><div style=\"position:relative; z-index:1; padding:20px; box-sizing:border-box;\"></div></div><div style=\"width:60%; background-color:#F50057; padding:40px; box-sizing:border-box; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:700; color:#0F1A2B; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:15px; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">OPTIMIZATION</span><h1 style=\"font-size:48px; font-weight:900; color:#0F1A2B; line-height:0.95; letter-spacing:-0.05em; margin:0 0 20px 0; text-shadow:4px 4px 0px rgba(15,26,43,0.3);\">Optimizing Model Performance</h1><p style=\"font-size:17px; font-weight:400; color:#0F1A2B; line-height:1.4; margin:0;\">Sustained AI efficacy requires constant calibration. Monitor data drift, retrain models systematically, and validate outputs against evolving benchmarks. Feature engineering remains a critical differentiator for predictive accuracy. A proactive maintenance cycle is non-negotiable.</p><div style=\"position:absolute; bottom:20px; right:30px; font-size:120px; font-weight:900; color:rgba(15,26,43,0.1); line-height:1; pointer-events:none;\">02</div></div></div>"},{"slide_index":2,"tag":"UX & INTERFACE","title":"The Human-AI Interface","background_style":"background-color: #EAEAEA;","html_content":"<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><div style=\"width:100%; height:100%; box-sizing:border-box; overflow:hidden; font-family:''Heebo'', sans-serif; position:relative; direction:ltr; background-color: #EAEAEA;\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:0; left:0; width:100%; height:60%; background-color: #EAEAEA; display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items:center;\"><img src=\"/uploads/gen_svg_1789125434808_2_625.svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; mix-blend-mode:multiply; opacity:0.8;\"/></div><div style=\"position:absolute; bottom:0; left:0; width:100%; height:40%; padding:30px 40px; box-sizing:border-box; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:flex-end; background-color:#EAEAEA;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:700; color:#F50057; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:10px; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">UX & INTERFACE</span><h1 style=\"font-size:48px; font-weight:900; color:#0F1A2B; line-height:0.95; letter-spacing:-0.05em; margin:0 0 15px 0;\">The Human-AI Interface</h1><p style=\"font-size:17px; font-weight:400; color:#0F1A2B; line-height:1.4; margin:0;\">Design AI for augmentative, not autonomous, operation. User experience is compromised when human agency is undermined. Implement clear feedback loops, allowing continuous human oversight and intervention. Transparency in decision-making processes builds user trust and system resilience.</p><div style=\"position:absolute; bottom:20px; right:30px; font-size:120px; font-weight:900; color:rgba(15,26,43,0.1); line-height:1; pointer-events:none;\">03</div></div></div>"}],"contrastReport":{"score":67,"status":"fail","totalElements":12,"passedElements":8,"failedElements":4,"slideResults":[{"slideNumber":1,"title":"AI Integration: Strategic Imperatives","elementsCount":5,"issuesCount":1,"hasBgImage":true,"hasOverlay":true,"issues":[{"element":"<span>","text":"STRATEGY","ratio":4.17,"targetRatio":4.5,"isPass":false,"issue":"Low contrast ratio (4.17:1 vs required 4.5:1 for WCAG AA). Color: #F50057 on #0F1A2B.","recommendation":"Use high-contrast color (e.g., #FFFFFF on dark or #1A202C on light) or add a backdrop overlay."}]},{"slideNumber":2,"title":"Optimizing Model Performance","elementsCount":6,"issuesCount":2,"hasBgImage":true,"hasOverlay":true,"issues":[{"element":"<span>","text":"OPTIMIZATION","ratio":4.17,"targetRatio":4.5,"isPass":false,"issue":"Low contrast ratio (4.17:1 vs required 4.5:1 for WCAG AA). Color: #0F1A2B on #F50057.","recommendation":"Use high-contrast color (e.g., #FFFFFF on dark or #1A202C on light) or add a backdrop overlay."},{"element":"<p>","text":"Sustained AI efficacy requires consta...","ratio":4.17,"targetRatio":4.5,"isPass":false,"issue":"Low contrast ratio (4.17:1 vs required 4.5:1 for WCAG AA). Color: #0F1A2B on #F50057.","recommendation":"Use high-contrast color (e.g., #FFFFFF on dark or #1A202C on light) or add a backdrop overlay."}]},{"slideNumber":3,"title":"The Human-AI Interface","elementsCount":5,"issuesCount":1,"hasBgImage":true,"hasOverlay":true,"issues":[{"element":"<span>","text":"UX & INTERFACE","ratio":3.48,"targetRatio":4.5,"isPass":false,"issue":"Low contrast ratio (3.48:1 vs required 4.5:1 for WCAG AA). Color: #F50057 on #EAEAEA.","recommendation":"Use high-contrast color (e.g., #FFFFFF on dark or #1A202C on light) or add a backdrop overlay."}]}]}}','202