 a seed, developing a woody trunk and branches. Its life cycle is measured in decades, producing fruit annually from a persistent, dormant state.</p><div style=\\\"width: 100%; text-align: right; font-size: 14px; color: #757575;\\\">Slide 1/2</div></div>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"slide_index\": 1,\n      \"tag\": \"Herbaceous\",\n      \"title\": \"Banana Plant\",\n      \"background_style\": \"background-color: #FF5722; color: #121212; font-family: ''Heebo'', sans-serif;\",\n      \"html_content\": \"<link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\"><div style=\\\"width:100%; height:100%; box-sizing:border-box; padding: 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-start; align-items: center; position: relative;\\\"><img src=\\\"/uploads/gen_1789362118445_0_727.jpg\\\" style=\\\"position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); width: 80%; height: auto; object-fit: cover; opacity: 0.3; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px #121212;\\\"><h1 style=\\\"font-size: 52px; line-height: 0.9; letter-spacing: -0.05em; margin: 0; position: relative; z-index: 1; text-align: center;\\\">Banana Plant</h1><p style=\\\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 400px; position: relative; z-index: 1; margin-top: 20px; text-align: center;\\\">Technically a giant herb, not a tree. Its ''trunk'' is a pseudostem formed by rolled leaves. It dies after fruiting, with new growth emerging from the rhizome.</p><div style=\\\"width: 100%; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; color: #424242; margin-top: auto; position: relative; z-index: 1;\\\">Slide 2/2</div></div>\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}]',0,0,0);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO posts (id,user_id,username,title,description,hashtags,tokens_prompt,tokens_save,tokens_autopost,carousel_data,created_at,chat_history,likes_count,is_liked,is_shared) VALUES ('p_ca975e14','u_ea2b4849','check','THE UNSEEN ARCHITECTURE','A brutalist exploration of AI implementation strategies. Minimalist, impactful, and devoid of fluff.','#AITips #DigitalStrategy #AvantGardeDesign',1707,565,0,'{"id":"p_ca975e14","author_name":"check","created_at":"2026-09-14T05:05:21.289Z","description":"A brutalist exploration of AI implementation strategies. Minimalist, impactful, and devoid of fluff.","hashtags":"#AITips #DigitalStrategy #AvantGardeDesign","slides":[{"slide_index":0,"tag":"Foundation","title":"THE UNSEEN ARCHITECTURE","background_style":"background-color: #0A0A0A;","html_content":"<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><div style=\"width:100%; height:100%; box-sizing:border-box; padding: 40px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start; color: #F0F0F0;\"><h1 style=\"font-family: ''Heebo'', sans-serif; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 0.9; letter-spacing: -0.06em; margin: 0; color: #FF4500;\">DEFINE YOUR AI</h1><p style=\"font-family: ''Heebo'', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.4; margin-top: 20px; color: #E0E0E0;\">Before implementation, a stark clarity on objectives is paramount. What specific problems will AI solve? Generic adoption yields generic results. Outline precise parameters for predictable outcomes.</p><img src=\"/uploads/gen_1789362291308_0_998.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; margin-top: 30px; border: 3px solid #FF4500; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px #000000;\"></div>"},{"slide_index":1,"tag":"Execution","title":"SYSTEMATIC INTEGRATION","background_style":"background-color: #FF4500;","html_content":"<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><div style=\"width:100%; height:100%; box-sizing:border-box; padding: 40px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:flex-end; align-items:center; color: #0A0A0A;\"><img src=\"/uploads/gen_1789362305550_1_216.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; margin-bottom: 30px; border: 3px solid #0A0A0A; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px #F0F0F0;\"><p style=\"font-family: ''Heebo'', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 20px; color: #0A0A0A; text-align: left;\">Data integrity forms the bedrock of intelligent systems. Standardize inputs meticulously. Implement rigorous validation protocols to preempt flawed learning cycles. The quality of output is directly proportional to the fidelity of ingestion.</p><h2 style=\"font-family: ''Heebo'', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.04em; margin: 0; color: #0A0A0A;\">CLEAN DATA, CLEAN AI</h2></div>"},{"slide_index":2,"tag":"Refinement","title":"ITERATIVE IMPROVEMENT","background_style":"background-color: #F0F0F0;","html_content":"<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><div style=\"width:100%; height:100%; box-sizing:border-box; padding: 40px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-end; color: #0A0A0A;\"><h1 style=\"font-family: ''Heebo'', sans-serif; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 0.9; letter-spacing: -0.06em; margin: 0; color: #0A0A0A;\">CONTINUOUS ANALYSIS</h1><img src=\"/uploads/gen_1789362316613_2_978.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; margin-top: 30px; border: 3px solid #0A0A0A; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px #FF4500;\"><p style=\"font-family: ''Heebo'', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.4; margin-top: 20px; color: #0A0A0A; text-align: right;\">AI is not a static deployment. Monitor performance metrics relentlessly. Identify deviations and anomalies. Use feedback loops to retrain and refine models, ensuring sustained relevance and efficacy in dynamic environments.</p></div>"}],"contrastReport":{"score":0,"status":"fail","totalElements":6,"passedElements":0,"failedElements":6,"slideResults":[{"slideNumber":1,"title":"THE UNSEEN ARCHITECTURE","elementsCount":4,"issuesCount":2,"hasBgImage":true,"hasOverlay":false,"issues":[{"element":"<h1>","text":"DEFINE YOUR AI","ratio":3.44,"targetRatio":3,"isPass":false,"issue":"Text is placed over background image/gradient without dark overlay or text-shadow protection.","recommendation":"Use high-contrast color (e.g., #FFFFFF on dark or #1A202C on light) or add a backdrop overlay."},{"element":"<p>","text":"Before implementation, a stark clarit...","ratio":1.32,"targetRatio":4.5,"isPass":false,"issue":"Low contrast ratio (1.32:1 vs required 4.5:1 for WCAG AA). Color: #E0E0E0 on #ffffff.","recommendation":"Use high-contrast color (e.g., #FFFFFF on dark or #1A202C on light) or add a backdrop overlay."}]},{"slideNumber":2,"title":"SYSTEMATIC INTEGRATION","elementsCount":4,"issuesCount":2,"hasBgImage":true,"hasOverlay":false,"issues":[{"element":"<p>","text":"Data integrity forms the bedrock of i...","ratio":19.8,"targetRatio":4.5,"isPass":false,"issue":"Text is placed over background image/gradient without dark overlay or text-shadow protection.","recommendation":"Use high-contrast color (e.g., #FFFFFF on dark or #1A202C on light) or add a backdrop overlay."},{"element":"<h2>","text":"CLEAN DATA, CLEAN AI","ratio":19.8,"targetRatio":3,"isPass":false,"issue":"Text is placed over background image/gradient without dark overlay or text-shadow protection.","recommendation":"Use high-contrast color (e.g., #FFFFFF on dark or #1A202C on light) or add a backdrop overlay."}]},{"slideNumber":3,"title":"ITERATIVE IMPROVEMENT","elementsCount":4,"issuesCount":2,"hasBgImage":true,"hasOverlay":false,"issues":[{"element":"<h1>","text":"CONTINUOUS ANALYSIS","ratio":19